# AI Visibility Audit — page served from the floorline-aeo-audit Netlify site
# under www.floorlineai.com/audit (200 = proxy/rewrite, the URL bar stays here).
# The /api/aeo-* calls are handled by netlify/edge-functions/audit-api.js, not
